{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days","id":37563,"title":"After listening to Darker Days...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-26T17:04:15-08:00","id":37563,"title":"After listening to Darker Days...","content":"I just listened to the interview with Ian from a year ago on Darker Days and now I'm super stoked about the Trinity Universe! I am loving the whole alternate future of Earth Presented in Aberrant and Trinity! So some questions!<br /> <br /> <br /> So what are the Arcologies like in the Federated States? I mean just how big are the Arcologies, because that Term can refer to vaaastly different levels of superstructure!<br /> <br /> What is Brazil and China like?<br /> <br /> Are the anomalies in Adventure all using the basic character creation rules, like spontaneous Vampires and Hallow Earth Lizard men?<br /> <br /> So would some Novas created in the Adventure Era evolve into the novas of Aberrant or would they just always be like that but just increase in number in the Aberrant times?<br /> <br /> How advanced is space tech in Aeon's time? Can you have Psionic Aliens? Do you get to play mixed groups of Earthers and Aliens?<br /> <br /> I really like the idea that Aeon allows you to play Mass Effect! :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T19:32:37-08:00","id":37614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just listened to the interview with Ian from a year ago on Darker Days and now I'm super stoked about the Trinity Universe! I am loving the whole alternate future of Earth Presented in Aberrant and Trinity! So some questions!</div> </div> </div> </div>First of all, bear in mind this is all current <b>Trinity Universe</b> information, any and all answers are subject to change in <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> setting...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what are the Arcologies like in the Federated States? I mean just how big are the Arcologies, because that Term can refer to vaaastly different levels of superstructure!</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC, the FSA is mostly self-contained &quot;megacities&quot; containing separate arcologies, rather than city-sized ones.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is Brazil and China like?</div> </div> </div> </div>Brazil is at the top of the major powers of an ascendant South America, developing advanced biotech and pharmaceuticals as the base of the Nor\u00e7a Order of Psions, as covered in the sourcebook <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/715/Terra-Verde-Psi-Order-Nor%C3%A7a-and-Sudam%C3%A9rica-Sourcebook\" target=\"_blank\">Terra Verde</a>.<br /> <br /> China is covered in the never-published but released free <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Asia_Ascendant:_Psi_Order_Ministry_%26_Asia_Sourcebook\" target=\"_blank\">Asia Ascendant</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the anomalies in Adventure all using the basic character creation rules, like spontaneous Vampires and Hallow Earth Lizard men?</div> </div> </div> </div>You could if you wanted to, although those examples are NPCs and not given full writeups in the book. As an example of what's possible, the pre-release demo scenario had a group of characters including Enkidu the talking genius gorilla.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So would some Novas created in the Adventure Era evolve into the novas of Aberrant or would they just always be like that but just increase in number in the Aberrant times?</div> </div> </div> </div>While Quantum-powered individuals have occurred throughout history, there was only one real Nova in the <b><i>Adventure!</i></b> era, Michael Donighal, later known as Divis Mal. The Quantum characters of the 1920s are Stalwarts, less powerful but more stable. (Likewise, the psi-powered Mesmerists are less powerful than <b>Trinity</b>-era Psions, but more flexible.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/37563-after-listening-to-darker-days#post37563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How advanced is space tech in Aeon's time? Can you have Psionic Aliens? Do you get to play mixed groups of Earthers and Aliens?</div> </div> </div> </div>Faster-than-light travel has been developed by humanity, but development was delayed when the teleporting Psion Order left Earth behind, and as of 2120 they're starting to re-contact extrasolar colonies. Some of the few sentient alien species in contact with humanity have psionic abilities - the Chromatics can effect light mentally, for example. Humanity's main alien ally the Qin has started to work with human groups, but no official rules for alien player characters were published.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T21:50:32-08:00","id":37690,"title":"","content":"Ahh cool thanks that was very helpful! I'm very Excited!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T04:24:04-08:00","id":37787,"title":"","content":"You're welcome, and glad to hear it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}